1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:09,278
This is PlotTwist Assignment Three, running Qwen two point five locally through Ollama. No paid API key is needed.

2
00:00:09,278 --> 00:00:21,296
Clue answers a business question using the supplied summary and PDF. The application labels the model mode and adds the required fictional starting price qualification when needed.

3
00:00:21,296 --> 00:00:32,818
The customer asks to save a birthday enquiry. The assistant asks for contact details. No write tool is available until the required fields are complete.

4
00:00:32,818 --> 00:00:45,275
After the customer supplies Aseel as the name, Clue remembers it and asks only for the remaining email address. Short-term history and validated state carry the earlier event brief.

5
00:00:45,275 --> 00:00:56,368
The fictional email completes the enquiry. The model requests the customer interest tool, and the application validates the arguments before writing the record.

6
00:00:56,368 --> 00:01:10,209
The expanded activity shows the actual function name, arguments and successful local save. Its observation returns to the model. Saving an enquiry does not book an event or send email.

7
00:01:10,209 --> 00:01:24,027
The business cannot confirm wheelchair access at a venue next Friday. The feedback tool logs the unknown question. Application boundary wording supplies explicit uncertainty if the model omits it.

8
00:01:24,027 --> 00:01:36,289
A complaint about difficult puzzles uses the feedback route. The actual tool observation confirms a local feedback record, without collecting unnecessary contact information.

9
00:01:36,289 --> 00:01:50,151
The casebook displays records belonging to this browser session. One lead, an unanswered access question and a feedback message are saved locally. Only fictional contact details are used.

10
00:01:50,151 --> 00:02:04,178
The reflection trace preserves the actual draft, revised reply and model checks. An unchanged reply means the model reviewed it without revising. Application edits have a separate trace label.

11
00:02:04,178 --> 00:02:16,900
This separate Reflection lab provides a deliberately flawed test draft. It invents a price, a venue booking and a sent email. The label makes the draft provenance explicit.

12
00:02:16,900 --> 00:02:29,162
The actual model removes those claims and describes custom work as quote-only. Review summaries can still be inaccurate, so the raw output and limitations remain documented.
